# 0332i = 0332b + MS OS 1.0 (WCID) on bcdUSB 2.00, gated by rubywinusb=4
# (default 0; modes 1-3 keep the MS OS 2.0 semantics).  Windows PnP OK and
# WinUSB bound on the first single flash; 0xEE, compat ID (wIndex 4) and
# properties (wIndex 5) were verified end-to-end.  Mode 4 bumps bcdDevice
# 0x0211 -> 0x0212 so Windows re-probes 0xEE instead of using its cache.
